.TH RFID-SCAN-PUBLISHER 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-scan-publisher \- standalone local RFID scan producer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-scan-publisher
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rfid-scan-publisher
owns the local RC522 reader and publishes scans without importing the Arthexis
runtime. It writes latest-scan JSON, scan logs, status JSON, LCD events, a
durable command queue, and optional card-list entries for local consumers.
.PP
The initial scan beep and LCD event acknowledge a detected card. Removing a
card before the deep-read hold time queues it. Holding it for six seconds by
default runs a deep read only when its local mapping declares
.B RFID_MODE_QUEUE_DEEP_DATA=1
and queues it when that read finishes, including when no deep data is
available. The RFID LCD event is released when the item is
queued. During deep read, the configured progress sound is emitted once per
second while the card identity and command label remain displayed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --scan-file " FILE"
Path for latest scan JSON.
.TP
.BI --queue-dir " DIR"
Directory containing durable pending, processing, interrupt, control, done,
failed, cleared, and interrupted command records.
.TP
.BI --log-file " FILE"
Path for append-only scan log.
.TP
.BI --status-file " FILE"
Path for publisher status JSON.
.TP
.BI --deep-hold-seconds " SECONDS"
Seconds a card must remain present before the automatic deep read. Default: 6.
.PP
A mapping with
.B RFID_MODE_QUEUE_INTERRUPT=1
is committed to the interrupt lane. A mapping with
.B RFID_MODE_QUEUE_DEEP_DATA=1
uses the deep-read trigger; other cards queue on removal.
.TP
.BI --cards-file " FILE"
Optional plain card list to append newly scanned UIDs to.
.TP
.BI --spi-bus " N"
SPI bus number.
.TP
.BI --spi-device " N"
SPI device number.
.TP
.BI --rst-pin " N"
RC522 reset pin. The local default is BCM 25.
.TP
.B --once
Wait for one scan, publish it, and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
systemctl status rfid-scan-publisher.service --no-pager
cat /home/arthe/.local/state/rfid-mode/rfid-scan-publisher.json
find /home/arthe/.local/state/rfid-mode/queue -type f
/home/arthe/.local/share/rfid-mode/.venv/bin/python /home/arthe/.local/bin/rfid-scan-publisher --once --once-timeout 5
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-commands (1),
.BR rfid-register (1),
.BR rfid-mode-runner (1)
